IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cpp-core-calendar`
IMPORT `cpp-core-age`
IMPORT `cp3-nouns`
IMPORT `cp3-contributory-period`

-- Tests of cp3-contributory-period.l4 (sections 49 to 50.2). Expected values are worked by hand from
-- the text. A month is written as the date of its first day.

§ `Tests -- section 49`

§§ `the first month`

-- born 10 March 1990: 18 on 10 March 2008, deemed on 1 April 2008, which is after 1966
#ASSERT `s 49 — the first month of the contributory period` (YMD 1990 3 10) EQUALS (YMD 2008 4 1)
-- born 20 May 1946: 18 on 20 May 1964, deemed 1 June 1964, before 1966: January 1966
#ASSERT `s 49 — the first month of the contributory period` (YMD 1946 5 20) EQUALS (YMD 1966 1 1)
-- born 15 January 1948: 18 on 15 January 1966, deemed 1 February 1966: later than January 1966
#ASSERT `s 49 — the first month of the contributory period` (YMD 1948 1 15) EQUALS (YMD 1966 2 1)
-- born 15 December 1947: 18 on 15 December 1965, deemed 1 January 1966: the two are the same day
#ASSERT `s 49 — the first month of the contributory period` (YMD 1947 12 15) EQUALS (YMD 1966 1 1)

§§ `the last month: paragraph (a), a benefit that commences before the end of 1986`

-- born 15 June 1920, 65 on 15 June 1985: the period includes the month of the birthday, June 1985
#ASSERT `s 49(a) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension that commences before the end of 1986` (YMD 1920 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS (YMD 1985 6 1)
-- a contribution for earnings made for March 1987, after 65: the period ends with that month
#ASSERT `s 49(a) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension that commences before the end of 1986` (YMD 1920 6 15) (JUST (YMD 1987 3 1)) NOTHING EQUALS (YMD 1987 3 1)
-- but not later than the month of death: died in January 1986
#ASSERT `s 49(a) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension that commences before the end of 1986` (YMD 1920 6 15) (JUST (YMD 1987 3 1)) (JUST (YMD 1986 1 20)) EQUALS (YMD 1986 1 1)
-- died after the 65th birthday month: no effect
#ASSERT `s 49(a) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension that commences before the end of 1986` (YMD 1920 6 15) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 1990 1 20)) EQUALS (YMD 1985 6 1)

§§ `the last month: paragraph (b), a benefit that commences after the end of 1986`

-- born 15 June 1940, 70 on 15 June 2010, deemed 1 July 2010: the month before is June 2010
#ASSERT `s 49(b) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension or a post-retirement disability benefit that commences after the end of 1986` (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS (YMD 2010 6 1)
-- the retirement pension commences with March 2005: the month before, February 2005, is the earliest
#ASSERT `s 49(b) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension or a post-retirement disability benefit that commences after the end of 1986` (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2005 3 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2005 2 1)
-- death in November 2004: the earliest
#ASSERT `s 49(b) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension or a post-retirement disability benefit that commences after the end of 1986` (YMD 1940 6 15) (JUST (YMD 2004 11 20)) (JUST (YMD 2005 3 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2004 11 1)
-- death in March 2005, the month the retirement pension commences: the month before it (February 2005) is earlier
#ASSERT `s 49(b) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension or a post-retirement disability benefit that commences after the end of 1986` (YMD 1940 6 15) (JUST (YMD 2005 3 20)) (JUST (YMD 2005 3 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2005 2 1)
-- retirement pension commencing with January 2006: the month before is December 2005 (the year rolls back)
#ASSERT `s 49(b) — the last month of the contributory period, for a benefit other than a disability pension or a post-retirement disability benefit that commences after the end of 1986` (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2006 1 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2005 12 1)

§§ `which paragraph applies`

-- a disability pension: section 49 gives no end
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a disability pension` (YMD 1986 12 1) (YMD 1920 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a disability pension` (YMD 1995 1 1) (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- a retirement pension commencing in December 1986: paragraph (a)
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a retirement pension` (YMD 1986 12 1) (YMD 1920 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 1985 6 1)
-- commencing in January 1987: paragraph (b)
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a retirement pension` (YMD 1987 1 1) (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 2010 6 1)
-- a survivor's pension commencing after 1986: paragraph (b)
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a survivor's pension` (YMD 1995 1 1) (YMD 1940 6 15) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 1994 8 3)) NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 1994 8 1)
-- a post-retirement disability benefit commencing after 1986: neither paragraph
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a post-retirement disability benefit` (YMD 2015 1 1) (YMD 1950 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- a post-retirement disability benefit commencing before the end of 1986 would be "a benefit other than a disability pension": paragraph (a)
#ASSERT `s 49 — the last month of the contributory period for a benefit` `a post-retirement disability benefit` (YMD 1986 6 1) (YMD 1920 6 15) NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST (YMD 1985 6 1)

§§ `the months excluded, and the count`

-- arguments: excluded for disability, the month the benefit is payable for, family allowance recipient, the year's base unadjusted pensionable earnings, the basic exemption
#ASSERT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` TRUE (YMD 2000 1 1) FALSE 5000 3500
-- a family allowance month in a year with earnings equal to the basic exemption: excluded ("equal to or less than")
#ASSERT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 2000 1 1) TRUE 3500 3500
#ASSERT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 2000 1 1) TRUE 3000 3500
-- earnings above the basic exemption: not excluded
#ASSERT NOT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 2000 1 1) TRUE 3500.01 3500
-- not a family allowance month
#ASSERT NOT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 2000 1 1) FALSE 3000 3500
-- a benefit payable for a month in December 1977: paragraph (d) does not reach it
#ASSERT NOT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 1977 12 1) TRUE 3000 3500
-- a benefit payable for January 1978: after December 1977, so it does
#ASSERT `s 49(c), (d) — a month is excluded from the contributory period` FALSE (YMD 1978 1 1) TRUE 3000 3500

-- a month in the period: between the first and last, both included, and not excluded
#ASSERT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 2005 6 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) FALSE
#ASSERT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) FALSE
#ASSERT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 2010 6 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 1999 12 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 2010 7 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 49 — a month is in the contributory period` (YMD 2005 6 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) TRUE
-- the count: January 2000 to June 2010 is 10 x 12 + 6 = 126 months; less 20 excluded: 106
#ASSERT `s 49 — the number of months in the contributory period` (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) 20 EQUALS 106
#ASSERT `s 49 — the number of months in the contributory period` (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2010 6 1) 0 EQUALS 126
-- one month in the period
#ASSERT `s 49 — the number of months in the contributory period` (YMD 2000 1 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) 0 EQUALS 1
-- the last month before the first: no months
#ASSERT `s 49 — the number of months in the contributory period` (YMD 2000 2 1) (YMD 2000 1 1) 0 EQUALS 0

§ `Tests -- sections 49.1 and 49.2`

-- born 10 March 1990: 18 deemed on 1 April 2008, before 2019: January 2019
#ASSERT `s 49.1 — the first month of the first additional contributory period` (YMD 1990 3 10) EQUALS (YMD 2019 1 1)
-- born 20 August 2005: 18 on 20 August 2023, deemed 1 September 2023: after 2019
#ASSERT `s 49.1 — the first month of the first additional contributory period` (YMD 2005 8 20) EQUALS (YMD 2023 9 1)
-- the same for 2024
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the first month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 1990 3 10) EQUALS (YMD 2024 1 1)
-- born 20 August 2005: 18 deemed on 1 September 2023, before 2024: January 2024 is the later
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the first month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 2005 8 20) EQUALS (YMD 2024 1 1)
-- born 5 May 2007: 18 on 5 May 2025, deemed 1 June 2025, after 2024
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the first month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 2007 5 5) EQUALS (YMD 2025 6 1)
-- born 5 May 1960: 70 on 5 May 2030, deemed 1 June 2030; the month before: May 2030
#ASSERT `s 49.1 — the last month of the first additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS (YMD 2030 5 1)
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the last month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS (YMD 2030 5 1)
-- retirement pension commencing with April 2025: March 2025
#ASSERT `s 49.1 — the last month of the first additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2025 4 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2025 3 1)
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the last month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2025 4 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2025 3 1)
-- death in January 2025, before the pension would commence: the month of death
#ASSERT `s 49.1 — the last month of the first additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) (JUST (YMD 2025 1 9)) (JUST (YMD 2025 4 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2025 1 1)
-- retirement pension commencing with January 2026: December 2025
#ASSERT `s 49.2 — the last month of the second additional contributory period` (YMD 1960 5 5) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)) EQUALS (YMD 2025 12 1)

§ `Tests -- sections 50 to 50.2`

#ASSERT `s 50 — the total pensionable earnings of a contributor` (LIST 100, 200, 300) EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `s 50 — the total pensionable earnings of a contributor` EMPTY EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 50.1 — the total first additional pensionable earnings of a contributor` (LIST 10.5, 20.25) EQUALS 30.75
#ASSERT `s 50.2 — the total second additional pensionable earnings of a contributor` (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4) EQUALS 10
